# WFORMTU.KEY - the tag pick list of the item form's Tags in
# TEST/WFORMT.C: INS adds items so that ITEM TAGS answers in two pages,
# the tags all on the second, and the list, loaded to the end, holds
# them, titled whole; SHIFT-INS's Esc, found by the wait between the
# pages, stops the next load after the first, the list empty and titled
# incomplete, not "No tags in use"; TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WFORMTU.SNP.
K INS
S FILLED
K F3 ALT-G F4
S WHOLE
K ESC ESC SHIFT-INS
K F3 ALT-G F4
S STOPPED
K ESC ESC
S ENDED
